---
/**
 * Clickable “Gamma Test Phase” explainer — shared by Business ladder & homepage catalog.
 * Uses native <dialog> for accessibility and mobile.
 */
---

<dialog id="gamma-test-phase-dialog" class="gamma-dialog" aria-labelledby="gamma-dialog-title">
  <div class="gamma-dialog__panel">
    <header class="gamma-dialog__header">
      <h2 id="gamma-dialog-title">Gamma Test Phase</h2>
      <button type="button" class="gamma-dialog__close" data-gamma-close aria-label="Close">
        ×
      </button>
    </header>

    <div class="gamma-dialog__body">
      <p>
        <strong>Gamma Test Phase</strong> means that the product is already ready to be used with
        real customers, but Meish is still testing, refining and calibrating how it is delivered
        before the established standard version.
      </p>
      <p>The customer receives the real Meish product and the promised deliverables.</p>

      <p>During Gamma Test Phase, Meish may still refine things such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>which questions produce the most useful insights</li>
        <li>which parts create the most value for the customer</li>
        <li>what should be removed</li>
        <li>how results should be presented</li>
        <li>how quickly insight can become action</li>
        <li>what should be improved before the established version</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Why Gamma Test Phase?</h3>
      <p>
        We do not want to finish products based only on our own assumptions. We want to see how
        they work with real businesses, real decisions and real situations.
      </p>
      <p>
        Gamma Test Phase helps us make the product:
        <em>clearer · more useful · faster · easier to buy · better in real use</em>.
      </p>

      <h3>What does it mean for the customer?</h3>
      <p>
        Gamma Test Phase customers receive the product at a lower test-phase price. In return,
        Meish may ask for brief feedback such as:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>What helped?</li>
        <li>What was unclear?</li>
        <li>What did you actually use?</li>
        <li>What would have made this more useful?</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The customer is <strong>not</strong> required to become part of a development project or
        do significant extra work.
      </p>

      <h3>Is the product unfinished?</h3>
      <p>
        No. Gamma Test Phase does not mean that the customer receives half a product. The agreed
        deliverables are still delivered. The test phase concerns primarily calibration, structure
        and delivery.
      </p>
      <p>
        After Gamma Test Phase, the content, structure or price may change based on what Meish
        has learned.
      </p>

      <p class="gamma-dialog__definition">
        <strong>Gamma Test Phase</strong> = a real product with real customers, in its final
        learning and calibration phase before the established version.
      </p>
    </div>

    <footer class="gamma-dialog__footer">
      <button type="button" class="button button--primary" data-gamma-close>Close</button>
    </footer>
  </div>
</dialog>

<style>
  .gamma-dialog {
    max-width: min(36rem, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    max-height: min(90vh, 40rem);
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(2, 12, 89, 0.12);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #fffbf5;
    color: var(--color-navy, #020c59);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(2, 12, 89, 0.18);
  }

  .gamma-dialog::backdrop {
    background: rgba(2, 12, 89, 0.45);
  }

  .gamma-dialog__panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    max-height: min(90vh, 40rem);
  }

  .gamma-dialog__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(2, 12, 89, 0.08);
  }

  .gamma-dialog__header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display, Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .gamma-dialog__close {
    appearance: none;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-navy, #020c59);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .gamma-dialog__close:hover,
  .gamma-dialog__close:focus-visible {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .gamma-dialog__body {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    overflow-y: auto;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .gamma-dialog__body h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display, Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0.4rem;
  }

  .gamma-dialog__body p {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .gamma-dialog__body ul {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .gamma-dialog__body li {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .gamma-dialog__definition {
    margin-top: 1rem !important;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(105, 94, 219, 0.08);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-lavender, #695edb);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  .gamma-dialog__footer {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(2, 12, 89, 0.08);
  }

  :global(button.gamma-phase-link) {
    appearance: none;
    border: none;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-lavender, #695edb);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  :global(button.gamma-phase-link:hover),
  :global(button.gamma-phase-link:focus-visible) {
    color: var(--color-navy, #020c59);
  }
</style>

<script>
  function setupGammaDialog() {
    const dialog = document.getElementById('gamma-test-phase-dialog') as HTMLDialogElement | null;
    if (!dialog) return;

    document.querySelectorAll('[data-gamma-open]').forEach((el) => {
      el.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        dialog.showModal();
      });
    });

    dialog.querySelectorAll('[data-gamma-close]').forEach((el) => {
      el.addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
    });

    dialog.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      if (e.target === dialog) dialog.close();
    });
  }

  setupGammaDialog();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', setupGammaDialog);
</script>
